{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q7028925","formula":"C₂₄H₂₆N₂O₄","hill":"C24H26N2O4","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":24.0,"H":26.0,"N":2.0,"O":4.0},"names":{"en":"Nicodicodine","uk":"Нікодикодин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Nicodicodine is an opioid developed as a cough suppressant and analgesic. Synthesized in 1904, it is not commonly used, but has activity similar to other opioids. Nicodicodine is metabolised in the liver by demethylation to produce 6-nicotinoyldihydromorphine, and subsequently further metabolised to dihydromorphine.","uk":"Нікодикодин (англ. Nicodicodine), відомий також під назвами «Нікодикодеїн» та «6-нікотиноїлдикодеїн» — це опіоїд, розроблений як протикашльовий засіб та анальгетик. Синтезований у 1904 році, він не використовується широко, але має активність, подібну до інших опіоїдів."},"fame":12,"pubchemCid":5464304,"mass":406.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"CN1CC[C@]23[C@@H]4[C@H]1CC5=C2C(=C(C=C5)OC)O[C@H]3[C@H](CC4)OC(=O)C6=CN=CC=C6","inchikey":"GTGRMWCOZHEYRL-MJFIPZRTSA-N","iupac":"[(4R,4aR,7S,7aR,12bS)-9-methoxy-3-methyl-2,4,4a,5,6,7,7a,13-octahydro-1H-4,12-methanobenzofuro[3,2-e]isoquinolin-7-yl] pyridine-3-carboxylate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5464304","atoms":56,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.65,"y":1.013,"z":-2.203,"el":"O"},{"x":1.37,"y":-0.547,"z":-1.298,"el":"O"},{"x":0.444,"y":3.547,"z":-1.242,"el":"O"},{"x":2.971,"y":-2.039,"z":-2.011,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.129,"y":-1.231,"z":0.945,"el":"N"},{"x":4.864,"y":-1.343,"z":1.712,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.956,"y":-0.509,"z":-0.848,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.961,"y":-1.793,"z":-0.017,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.991,"y":-0.409,"z":-2.045,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.712,"y":-1.475,"z":1.312,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.422,"y":-0.179,"z":-1.218,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.393,"y":0.626,"z":-0.073,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.569,"y":-2